msgid "Control the mini screen of the Positivo Vision laptop"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:15
msgid ""
"Shows the time, weather, battery, connections, a reminder and WhatsApp "
"messages on the small screen next to the keyboard of the Positivo Vision "
"R15M, and lets you choose its GIF. An independent, open source replacement "
"for the official app that works on any distribution."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:22
msgid "Weather forecast for the chosen city, without an API key"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:23
msgid "Battery, Wi-Fi and Bluetooth status"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:24
msgid "Brightness and automatic page rotation"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:25
msgid "The laptop's mini screen key switches pages"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:26
msgid ""
"The mini screen turns off when the laptop suspends or the session is locked"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:27
msgid "Factory GIFs, imported from the official package"
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:29
msgid ""
"The mini screen needs a one-time setup on the host system, which the app "
"explains. It gives the logged-in user access to the device and nothing else."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:33
msgid "Not affiliated with Positivo Tecnologia or PoliCorp Tecnologia."
msgstr ""

#: data/dev.pragmatico.Minitela.metainfo.xml:60
